                                    <div class="cardgeneric_body card-bg-silver">
                                        
                                        <h3 class="cardgeneric_heading ">Update from Justin Young, RICS CEO - September 2026</h3>
                                        
                                            <p class="ellipses-3-lines cardgeneric_content m-0 ">
                                                Recently I have been reflecting on relevance. It is a word I hear often when talking about surveying, whether in conversations about the skills needed to deliver more homes, the way we connect with students considering their future careers, or how surveying adapts to technological change and reform.
