                                        <h3 class="cardgeneric_heading ">RICS opens Riyadh office to strengthen professional standards and skills in Saudi Arabia</h3>
                                        
                                            <p class="ellipses-3-lines cardgeneric_content m-0 ">
                                                The Royal Institution of Chartered Surveyors (RICS) has announced the opening of an office in Riyadh, strengthening its support for its membership in the Kingdom, which has more than doubled to almost 2,500 in the past four years.
                                            </p>
                                        
                                        
                                        
